                cx="240"
                cy="500"
                fill="#be185d"
                r="8"
                stroke="#ffffff"
                stroke-width="2"
              />
              <circle
                cx="240"
                cy="500"
                fill="none"
                r="19"
                stroke="#be185d"
                stroke-dasharray="3 3"
                stroke-width="1.5"
              />
              <circle
                cx="784"
                cy="500"
                fill="#be185d"
                r="8"
                stroke="#ffffff"
                stroke-width="2"
              />
              <circle
                cx="784"
                cy="500"
                fill="none"
                r="19"
                stroke="#be185d"
                stroke-dasharray="3 3"
                stroke-width="1.5"
              />
              <line
                marker-end="url(#arrowBar)"
                marker-start="url(#arrowBarRev)"
                stroke="#be185d"
                stroke-width="4"
                x1="248"
                x2="776"
                y1="250"
                y2="250"
              />
              <rect
                fill="#ffffff"
                height="110"
                rx="16"
                stroke="#be185d"
                stroke-width="3"
                width="600"
                x="212"
                y="760"
              />
              <text
                fill="#9d174d"
                font-family="sans-serif"
                font-size="30"
                font-weight="bold"
                text-anchor="middle"
                x="512"
                y="808"
              >
                HANDLEBAR WIDTH (mm)
              </text>
              <text
                fill="#475569"
                font-family="sans-serif"
                font-size="20"
                font-weight="600"
                text-anchor="middle"
                x="512"
                y="846"
              >
                [CENTER → CENTER]
              </text>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="space-y-4 flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <div
            class="space-y-3"
          >
            <p
              class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70"
            >
              Measure center to center (C-C) across the top of the brake hoods or the drops.
            </p>
            <div
              class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500"
            >
              Recommended measurement procedure:
            </div>
            <ol
              class="space-y-2.5"
            >
              <li
                class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed shadow-xs"
              >
                <span
                  class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-mono font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                >
                  1
                </span>
                <span>
                  Find the center of the handlebar tube on the left and on the right, across the top of the brake hoods or at the drops.
                </span>
              </li>
              <li
                class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed shadow-xs"
              >
                <span
                  class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-mono font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                >
                  2
                </span>
                <span>
                  Measure from the center of the left tube to the center of the right tube (center to center, C-C).
                </span>
              </li>
              <li
                class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed shadow-xs"
              >
                <span
                  class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-mono font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                >
                  3
                </span>
                <span>
                  Record the width in mm. Common sizes are 380, 400, 420 and 440 mm; many bars have the size printed on them.
                </span>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>
          <div
            class="border-l-4 border-emerald-500 bg-emerald-50/70 p-3.5 rounded-r-xl space-y-1 border border-emerald-200/60"
          >
            <div
              class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-800"
            >
              CLINICAL BIOMECHANICS & EVIDENCE
            </div>
            <p
              class="text-xs text-emerald-900 leading-relaxed"
            >
              The knowledge base wants the handlebar width to equal your acromion width, rounded to 380, 400, 420 or 440 mm. A 420 mm factory bar on 380 mm shoulders compresses the ulnar nerve.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-900 text-xs leading-relaxed"
          >
            Precision clinical notice: Keep the tape measure perpendicular to the reference plane.
          </div>
          <div
            class="pt-2"
          >
            <button
              class="w-full py-3.5 px-4 rounded-full bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 active:bg-blue-800 font-semibold text-xs tracking-wider uppercase text-white transition-all shadow-sm focus:outline-none"
              type="button"
            >
              Close Guide
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocumentFragment>
`;

