                font-family="sans-serif"
                font-size="31"
                font-weight="bold"
                text-anchor="middle"
                x="807"
                y="566"
              >
                INSEAM (mm)
              </text>
              <text
                fill="#475569"
                font-family="sans-serif"
                font-size="22"
                font-weight="600"
                text-anchor="middle"
                x="807"
                y="607"
              >
                [FLOOR → BOOK EDGE]
              </text>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="space-y-4 flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <div
            class="space-y-3"
          >
            <div
              class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500"
            >
              Recommended measurement procedure:
            </div>
            <ol
              class="space-y-2.5"
            >
              <li
                class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed shadow-xs"
              >
                <span
                  class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-mono font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                >
                  1
                </span>
                <span>
                  Stand barefoot in cycling shorts with your back against a flat wall, heels 15 cm apart.
                </span>
              </li>
              <li
                class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed shadow-xs"
              >
                <span
                  class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-mono font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                >
                  2
                </span>
                <span>
                  Place a thin hardcover book (or a carpenter's level) between your legs and pull it firmly up into the crotch, simulating real saddle sit-bone pressure.
                </span>
              </li>
              <li
                class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed shadow-xs"
              >
                <span
                  class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-mono font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                >
                  3
                </span>
                <span>
                  Measure the vertical distance from the top edge of the book to the floor in mm.
                </span>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>
          <div
            class="border-l-4 border-emerald-500 bg-emerald-50/70 p-3.5 rounded-r-xl space-y-1 border border-emerald-200/60"
          >
            <div
              class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-800"
            >
              CLINICAL BIOMECHANICS & EVIDENCE
            </div>
            <p
              class="text-xs text-emerald-900 leading-relaxed"
            >
              Precision is critical: a 10 mm error in inseam shifts the saddle height by 8.8 mm (LeMond 0.883), which can overload the patellar tendon or strain the Achilles. Check the result: at the bottom of the pedal stroke the knee should be extended by 30°–35°, and with the heel on the pedal the leg should be straight without tilting the pelvis.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-900 text-xs leading-relaxed"
          >
            Precision clinical notice: Keep the tape measure perpendicular to the reference plane.
          </div>
          <div
            class="pt-2"
          >
            <button
              class="w-full py-3.5 px-4 rounded-full bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 active:bg-blue-800 font-semibold text-xs tracking-wider uppercase text-white transition-all shadow-sm focus:outline-none"
              type="button"
            >
              Close Guide
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocumentFragment>
`;

