                >
                  2
                </span>
                <span>
                  Find the point on the saddle where its width is 70 mm (the sit-bone reference point of the knowledge base).
                </span>
              </li>
              <li
                class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed shadow-xs"
              >
                <span
                  class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-mono font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                >
                  3
                </span>
                <span>
                  Measure with a tape along the seat tube line from the center of the Bottom Bracket (BB) spindle to the top of the saddle at the 70 mm width point, in mm.
                </span>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>
